{
  "name": "building-menu-visual",
  "description": "Visual check of building selection menu: open build types, order multiple buildings, list placed buildings, inspect scores and state. #556 visual-testing follow-up: ordering a building queues a construction site instead of placing it instantly -- every order step now asserts buildingCount unchanged + orderedBuildingCount:1, followed by a waitUntil that drives the site to completion before the next order, matching the treatment already applied to building-placement-visual.json.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game seed:42 cash:250000 staffed:true",
      "timeout": 30,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game seed:42 cash:250000 staffed:true"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "description": "cash:250000 belongs on `new_game` here, not on a `campaign start`: this scenario never enters a campaign level, so `new_game` is the only step that decides cash (world.ts passes `cash:` through as `startingCash`). #556 visual-testing follow-up: staffed:true added so a free roster exists to actually walk to and work each ordered site -- without it every order below would queue forever and buildingCount would never reach 1 (the same reason building-placement-visual.json carries it). Cash bumped from 100000 to 250000 for the same reason that scenario's own budget was bumped: the six buildings' $83,000 combined cost is only part of the bill once construction takes real time -- a 5-person staffed roster draws salary/upkeep across the ~330 ticks the six orders take to complete in sequence, confirmed against the fixed order-then-build path (~$185,000 all in). 100000 ran the balance negative by the fourth building and left the last two permanently unaffordable.",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 250000,
          "buildingCount": 0,
          "employeeCount": 5
        },
        "note": "the cash: override replaces the sandbox's $50,000 default outright"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build types",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build types"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "build list",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build list"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "build living_quarters at:5,5",
      "description": "#556: order-time validation and charging are unchanged from a direct placement -- only the result differs: a construction site is queued (orderedBuildingCount:1) instead of the building existing immediately (buildingCount stays 0). This step's own auto-captured screenshot is the 'ghost appears at order' checkpoint.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"build\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"living_quarters\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 5,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -10000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 0,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 1
        },
        "note": "Ordered, not placed: the site is queued for construction, no building exists yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:buildingCount equals:1 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "Drive the living_quarters site to completion.",
      "timeout": 90,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "buildingCount",
          "equals": 1,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 85000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 1,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build management_office at:10,5",
      "description": "#556: same order-then-build semantics as the order above.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"management_office\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 10,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -8000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 1,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 1
        },
        "note": "living_quarters already stands from the previous order; management_office is now queued, not yet built."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:buildingCount equals:2 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "Drive the management_office site to completion.",
      "timeout": 90,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "buildingCount",
          "equals": 2,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 85000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 2,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build driving_center at:15,5",
      "description": "#556: same order-then-build semantics as the orders above.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"driving_center\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 15,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -12000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 2,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:buildingCount equals:3 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "Drive the driving_center site to completion.",
      "timeout": 90,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "buildingCount",
          "equals": 3,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 85000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 3,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build explosive_warehouse at:20,5",
      "description": "#556: same order-then-build semantics as the orders above.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"explosive_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 20,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -20000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 3,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:buildingCount equals:4 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "Drive the explosive_warehouse site to completion.",
      "timeout": 90,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "buildingCount",
          "equals": 4,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 85000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 4,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build freight_warehouse at:5,10",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"freight_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"freight_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 5,
          "z": 10
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "description": "Was an unmarked command step that reached cash -$15,000: the Build panel disables a buy button on `cash < def.constructionCost` (BuildMenu.ts) so no click could place this, while the console `build` command overdrew happily. The console now refuses an unaffordable build too, and with the level funded at $250,000 there is well over $15,000 in hand against a $15,000 warehouse -- the button is enabled and this is a genuine player click. The awaitUsable ahead of it is the affordability assertion: an underfunded run fails here instead of quietly overdrawing. #556: order-then-build semantics as above -- the site is queued, not placed.",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -15000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 4,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:buildingCount equals:5 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "Drive the freight_warehouse site to completion.",
      "timeout": 90,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "buildingCount",
          "equals": 5,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 85000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 5,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build vehicle_depot at:10,10",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"vehicle_depot\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"vehicle_depot\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 10,
          "z": 10
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "description": "The second former overdraw step, converted the same way: comfortably over $18,000 in hand against an $18,000 depot, so the catalog row is enabled and the click lands. Cash stays positive through the whole build-out, which is the point of funding the scenario instead of letting the console overdraw. #556: order-then-build semantics as above -- the site is queued, not placed.",
      "expect": {
        "changedBy": {
          "cash": -18000
        },
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 5,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "wait_until field:buildingCount equals:6 max_ticks:300",
      "description": "Drive the vehicle_depot site to completion.",
      "timeout": 90,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "waitUntil",
          "field": "buildingCount",
          "equals": 6,
          "maxTicks": 300,
          "timeoutMs": 85000
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "buildingCount": 6,
          "orderedBuildingCount": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
